   "t0": 0.18,
   "t1": 4.56,
   "kind": "truth",
   "spk": "Nell",
   "label": "Nell",
   "text": "In the Voice House, everyone was asleep, except Pip, the smallest pillow on the sofa."
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.44,
   "t1": 10.56,
   "kind": "truth",
   "spk": "Pip",
   "label": "Pip",
   "text": "Nell? Nell, are you awake? The lamp in the hallway is humming, and I can't stop listening to it."
  },
  {
   "t0": 11.36,
   "t1": 15.96,
   "kind": "truth",
   "spk": "Nell",
   "label": "Nell",
   "text": "Pip tiptoed up the stairs, past forty sleeping portraits, all the way to the attic door."
  },
  {
   "t0": 16.32,
   "t1": 18.48,
   "kind": "truth",
   "spk": "Hoot",
   "label": "Hoot",
   "text": "Who goes there, at this hour of the night?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.94,
   "t1": 22.52,
   "kind": "truth",
   "spk": "Pip",
   "label": "Pip",
   "text": "It's only me, Professor Hoot. The hallway lamp won't stop humming."
  },
  {
   "t0": 23.52,
   "t1": 28.5,
   "kind": "truth",
   "spk": "Hoot",
   "label": "Hoot",
   "text": "Hmm. Lamps don't hum for nothing, little one. Lamps hum when they're lonely."
  },
  {
   "t0": 28.5,
   "t1": 31.06,
   "kind": "truth",
   "spk": "Nell",
   "label": "Nell",
   "text": "Just then, a tiny voice squeaked from inside the pantry."
  },
  {
   "t0": 31.8,
   "t1": 35.32,
   "kind": "truth",
   "spk": "Tilly",
